-- Edition: 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation, as deposited at ../../registers/source-bundle/PEA1958.txt (amendments to
-- Act 5 of 2025 and S 566/2023).
--
-- WHY THIS ACT. Cited by 13 of the 527 Singapore Acts deposited in this repository. SCOPED to whether a licence is needed and the
-- consequences of not having one. Not encoded: the application process, conditions, security, refusal and cancellation, demerit
-- points, arts classification, appeals, enforcement powers, and the exemption orders under s 23 (not retrieved).
